# Candidate release metadata, read by make-release.sh, generate-sbom.py and
# the Stage19 archive harness. Cargo package versions equal RELEASE_VERSION
# since Stage33 (decision 2-i). RELEASE_VERSION is injected into release
# binaries; PRODUCTION_CODE_COMMIT is the last commit that changed shipped
# code or dependencies.
